ding=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Vampire%20Shield\"><img alt=\"Vampire Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Vampire_Shield_11bfca.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Guardian Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Guardian_Shield_1a3c3e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Rapier\"><img alt=\"Ice Rapier\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ice_Rapier_7805e9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spike%20Sword\"><img alt=\"Spike Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spike_Sword_4068aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ancient Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Shield_0b428c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.1<br/>December 17, 2002<br/>Christmas Update 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Ghostship</b> is a ship that you can get on whilst travelling from <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> using the <a href=\"#/wiki/Boat\">boat</a>. The chance of encountering the ship is 10% . There's also a small possibility of getting on this ship by failing at mission 9 of the Shadows of Yalahar Quest. \n</p><p>To get off this ship, go down the ladder, follow the bridge south (kill some <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>), go up the ladder in the northeast corner and walk into the portal to be teleported to <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>. A <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghost\">Ghost</a> protects the portal; you can either kill it or ignore it.\n</p><p>There's also a little quest for you to do here.\nThe <a href=\"#/quest/plate-armor-quest\">Plate Armor Quest</a> is located here.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Monsters on the deck of the Ghostship.</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\"><img alt=\"Skeleton\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Skeleton_3b820b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeleton</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">35</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">50</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">30 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">17 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">13 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bone\">Bone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pelvis%20Bone\">Pelvis Bone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Viking%20Helmet\">Viking Helmet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hatchet\">Hatchet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\">Heavy Old Tome</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Mace (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Shield\">Brass Shield</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sword\">Sword</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\"><img alt=\"Ghoul\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghoul_8f4d49.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghoul</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">85</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">97 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">27 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Rotten Piece of Cloth (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul%20Snack\">Ghoul Snack</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Torch\">Torch</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Old%20Tome\">Heavy Old Tome</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brown%20Pi